sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / oc CLI
    participant Pod as must-gather Pod<br/>gather.sh
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Collectors as Component Collectors<br/>(16 parallel processes)
    participant LLMD as LLM-D Subsystem<br/>gather_llmd.sh
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/must-gather/

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,FS: Flow 1: OpenShift Full Collection
        User->>Pod: oc adm must-gather<br/>Image pull auth
        Pod->>K8sAPI: Detect K8s distribution<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: OpenShift detected
        Pod->>K8sAPI: oc adm inspect namespaces<br/>DSCI, DSC, Component CRs
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Platform-level resources
        Pod->>Collectors: Dispatch COMPONENT=all<br/>(background PIDs)
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: Read component CRDs<br/>per-component namespace discovery
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: InferenceService, RayCluster,<br/>Workload, PyTorchJob, etc.
        Collectors->>LLMD: KServe delegates to LLM-D
        LLMD->>K8sAPI: cert-manager, Sail/Istio, LWS,<br/>Gateway API, monitoring CRDs
        K8sAPI-->>LLMD: Dependency resources
        LLMD->>K8sAPI: InferencePool, InferenceObjective,<br/>ServiceMonitor, PodMonitor
        K8sAPI-->>LLMD: LLM-D resources
        Pod->>K8sAPI: helm get values/manifests
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Helm release data
        Collectors-->>Pod: Collection complete<br/>(PID wait + failure report)
        Pod->>FS: Write collected data to /must-gather/
        User->>Pod: oc rsync (tar archive copy)
        Pod-->>User: Compressed diagnostic archive
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over User,FS: Flow 2: xKS Collection (AKS/EKS/CKS)
        User->>Pod: kubectl apply -f job.yaml<br/>Image pull secret
        Pod->>K8sAPI: detect_k8s_distro()<br/>Node metadata, provider IDs
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: AKS/EKS/CKS detected
        Pod->>K8sAPI: kubectl_inspect<br/>Auto-discover API resources
        K8sAPI-->>Pod: Namespaced resources, pod logs
        Pod->>Collectors: KServe + AI Gateway only<br/>(xKS default)
        Collectors->>K8sAPI: KServe, LLM-D, AI Gateway CRDs
        K8sAPI-->>Collectors: Component resources
        Collectors-->>Pod: Collection complete
        Pod->>FS: Write collected data
        User->>Pod: kubectl cp
        Pod-->>User: Diagnostic archive
    end
